# Campus AI - Environment Variables Configuration

# 1. Supabase Project Credentials
# Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# Find these in Project Settings -> API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# 2. Admin Portal Provisioning Secret
# This code protects the /admin/signup route so only authorized college staff can create admin accounts
VITE_ADMIN_INVITE_CODE=CAMPUS_ADMIN_2025

# 3. Optional: Real LLM Integration (Modular Chatbot Hook)
# Campus AI includes a fully local, free retrieval system out of the box.
# If you wish to enable a generative LLM in the future, set your API key:
# VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=
# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
